              "content": "(ii) Is it possible to mix water from the Dead Sea and purified drinking water to get a mixture with the salinity of groundwater? Why/Why not? What quantity of purified drinking water should Dorjee mix with 1 litre of water from the Dead Sea to get a mixture having the salinity of groundwater?"
